{"2907120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Just Wing It", "steam_appid": 2907120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/401ae0c67aa828e349176c2575c87272.avif?t=1765805312\" width=190 height=89 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, discover and photograph!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through the open seas, bird spotting with your trusted binoculars! Find rare birds and collect photos, feathers and gear to help you and up to 3 friends make it big!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer your boat across the open seas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot rare birds across the ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> photos and feathers, to trade in for critter coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>upgrades</strong> to accelerate your money-making journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/2b69d740aa0907d9a013b6697a710751.avif?t=1765805312\" width=232 height=89 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip outfits, new colours and boat upgrades</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand out </strong>with tons of unique outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your boat with useful upgrades and cosmetics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/7765b87bdfe995ab31f3b2cb31994676.avif?t=1765805312\" width=232 height=89 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hangout and voyage with friends</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat, allowing for fun interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to find the rarest birds in the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe there is even room for betrayal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/023eb3d657810cadfd689c7d4a2fc7ae.avif?t=1765805312\" width=100 height=76 /></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/401ae0c67aa828e349176c2575c87272.avif?t=1765805312\" width=190 height=89 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, discover and photograph!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through the open seas, bird spotting with your trusted binoculars! Find rare birds and collect photos, feathers and gear to help you and up to 3 friends make it big!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer your boat across the open seas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot rare birds across the ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> photos and feathers, to trade in for critter coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>upgrades</strong> to accelerate your money-making journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/2b69d740aa0907d9a013b6697a710751.avif?t=1765805312\" width=232 height=89 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip outfits, new colours and boat upgrades</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand out </strong>with tons of unique outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your boat with useful upgrades and cosmetics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/7765b87bdfe995ab31f3b2cb31994676.avif?t=1765805312\" width=232 height=89 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hangout and voyage with friends</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat, allowing for fun interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to find the rarest birds in the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe there is even room for betrayal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/023eb3d657810cadfd689c7d4a2fc7ae.avif?t=1765805312\" width=100 height=76 /></span></h2>", "short_description": "In Just Wing It, you have one task: birdwatch. Except, things may not be so easy… various obstacles, twists, and surprises will keep you and up to 4 players on your toes as you spot rare birds through the sea. Will you make riches or will you make a splash in the open ocean?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/dda556dec1df23faa8f8ea0754afab2454742a66/header.jpg?t=176580531